{
  "$comment": [
    "Conformance corpus for the rendercv-go parity contract (specs/000-parity-contract/spec.md).",
    "Each case is run against the vendored Python RenderCV by tools/gengolden, in a clean temp",
    "directory. Everything the run creates is captured into testdata/golden/<name>/, together",
    "with stdout, stderr and the exit code. Paths in `files` are relative to third_party/rendercv."
  ],
  "env": {
    "COLUMNS": "80",
    "NO_COLOR": "1",
    "TERM": "dumb"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "theme_classic",
      "axis": "artifacts",
